@baseUrl = http://localhost:5195

### Obtener usuarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Accept: application/json

### Obtener usuario por Id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Accept: application/json

### Obtener usuario por Auth0 User Id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/by-auth0/auth0%7Cdemo-user-001
Accept: application/json

### Crear usuario
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "auth0UserId": "auth0|demo-user-004",
  "name": "Luis Hernandez",
  "email": "luis.hernandez@example.com",
  "isActive": true
}

### Actualizar usuario
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "auth0UserId": "auth0|demo-user-001",
  "name": "Ana Lopez Actualizada",
  "email": "ana.lopez@example.com",
  "isActive": true
}

### Eliminar usuario
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/3
